{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/dd893027b95dd0fb28df62c32548f86b.avif?t=1758267181\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Food Truck Story</i>, you play as a recent college graduate unsure of what\u2019s next. The traditional 9-to-5 grind doesn't appeal to you, and you're stuck living at home with no clear direction. But when inspiration (and desperation) strike, you decide to take a bold leap: launch your very own food truck business in a bustling college town full of students, locals, and hungry opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing but a borrowed van, a small loan, and a lot of hope, you begin your journey. But running a business isn\u2019t easy \u2014 especially when you\u2019re juggling money problems, health inspections, burnout, and fierce competition. And that\u2019s not even counting the personal challenges: building friendships, navigating awkward romances, dealing with family expectations, and figuring out who you really want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>story-rich, choice-driven visual novel</strong> where <strong>every decision matters</strong>. Who will you trust? How will you grow your brand? Will you focus on flavor, fame, or friendship? Your choices shape your story \u2014 and your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/0946816a50ae33b361c21fd1c075cfa4.poster.avif?t=1758267181\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/0946816a50ae33b361c21fd1c075cfa4.webm?t=1758267181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/0946816a50ae33b361c21fd1c075cfa4.mp4?t=1758267181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>What to Expect:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relationship Paths</strong> \u2013 Meet a diverse cast of characters. Form friendships, rivalries, and explore possible romantic connections.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings &amp; Replayability</strong> \u2013 Whether you rise to the top, crash and burn, or find meaning in unexpected places, the story branches in multiple directions. Replaying with different choices reveals new scenes, outcomes, and relationships.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Stylized Visual Art &amp; Expressive Characters</strong> \u2013 Enjoy a vibrant, hand-crafted visual style with unique character designs, expressive portraits, and immersive backdrops that bring the college town to life.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modern, Relatable Writing</strong> \u2013 Sharp, character-driven dialogue with humor, heart, and emotional realism. This isn\u2019t just about food \u2014 it\u2019s about finding your purpose when life doesn\u2019t go according to plan.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/171336db521920f87c04030abf22e2c7.poster.avif?t=1758267181\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/171336db521920f87c04030abf22e2c7.webm?t=1758267181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/171336db521920f87c04030abf22e2c7.mp4?t=1758267181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc9e <strong>Build Relationships, Explore Romance</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meet a diverse cast of characters \u2014 friendly students, competitive foodies, charming locals, and mysterious newcomers. As your story unfolds, you\u2019ll get to know them through branching dialogue, optional scenes, and romantic paths. Some relationships may lead to deep connections... and some may lead to heartbreak.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/d896c9c26f5d9ac9c5b141b8edc3c294.poster.avif?t=1758267181\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/d896c9c26f5d9ac9c5b141b8edc3c294.webm?t=1758267181\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/d896c9c26f5d9ac9c5b141b8edc3c294.mp4?t=1758267181\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986320?t=1758267181","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3986320?t=1758267181","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/a62efa5e987001313ce1e0af80efdd7bcd205e87/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758267181","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/a62efa5e987001313ce1e0af80efdd7bcd205e87/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758267181","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,3,4,5],"notes":"The game graphically depicts sex, usage of drugs and extreme violence. The story is not intended for players being in a dark period of their lives. If you are easily offended or just looking for a fun game only, this game is not for you."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/dd893027b95dd0fb28df62c32548f86b.avif?t=1758267181\" data-has-big width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Food Truck Story</i>, you play as a recent college graduate unsure of what\u2019s next. The traditional 9-to-5 grind doesn't appeal to you, and you're stuck living at home with no clear direction. But when inspiration (and desperation) strike, you decide to take a bold leap: launch your very own food truck business in a bustling college town full of students, locals, and hungry opportunity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With nothing but a borrowed van, a small loan, and a lot of hope, you begin your journey. But running a business isn\u2019t easy \u2014 especially when you\u2019re juggling money problems, health inspections, burnout, and fierce competition. And that\u2019s not even counting the personal challenges: building friendships, navigating awkward romances, dealing with family expectations, and figuring out who you really want to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a <strong>story-rich, choice-driven visual novel</strong> where <strong>every decision matters</strong>. Who will you trust? How will you grow your brand? Will you focus on flavor, fame, or friendship? Your choices shape your story \u2014 and your future.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/0946816a50ae33b361c21fd1c075cfa4.poster.avif?t=1758267181\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3986320/extras/0946816a50ae33b361c21fd1c075cfa4.webm?t=1758267181\" type=\"vi